Here is where accounts are located

It's just a folder per person/account with their own saved data:
  Desktop Layout - Icons, Dock, Fragments, Windows, Apps
  Image Files - Image Window, Gallery Window (Backgrounds)
  Text Files - Notes / To Do / Features Windows
  Uml Files - Uml Window: UML data (.uml or .xml)
  Xml Files - Xml Window: XML standard files (.xml)
  Xaml Files - Xaml Window: XAML data (.xaml or .xml)

These are all files and data the have created or personalize including imported ones dragged into the OS
